    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>VisiTD - Monster War: Dying Fire -</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2705\ufe0f Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Human civilization is nearing its end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An overwhelming swarm of hostile extraterrestrial creatures known as &quot;CREEP&quot; now fills the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Worse yet, they continue to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The great superpowers \u2014 America, Russia, China, and others \u2014 have already fallen.<br>The surviving remnants of humanity have gathered what little strength remains, clinging to a faint hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As humanity's final commander, it is your mission to construct and upgrade evolving turrets, built using adapted enemy technology, in an effort to delay the inevitable extinction of mankind for even a little longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2015\u2015Death will come for you. But it must come as late as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;Protips from your predecessor, who fell honorably in battle:&gt;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When a turret fully upgrades two of its skills, it will unlock a special ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each turret, created with enemy technology, gains experience and grows stronger with every enemy defeated.<br>As they level up, their attack power increases, and they are able to attack faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">May your final stand be one without regret, having given everything you had.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705\ufe0f Turrets gain experience and level up! (Each turret keeps a separate kill count!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990220/extras/69097025c85dd5d6b0abf843347e3eb9.poster.avif?t=1747473653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990220/extras/69097025c85dd5d6b0abf843347e3eb9.webm?t=1747473653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990220/extras/69097025c85dd5d6b0abf843347e3eb9.mp4?t=1747473653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705\ufe0f Upgrade turret skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990220/extras/df18f8d9515d5fd764a8f4a47a7fae99.poster.avif?t=1747473653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990220/extras/df18f8d9515d5fd764a8f4a47a7fae99.webm?t=1747473653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990220/extras/df18f8d9515d5fd764a8f4a47a7fae99.mp4?t=1747473653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705\ufe0f Turrets unlock special abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2734\ufe0f <i>Before the turret gains its special power:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990220/extras/abf08a966a2be3159c14a28e4347cf03.poster.avif?t=1747473653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990220/extras/abf08a966a2be3159c14a28e4347cf03.webm?t=1747473653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990220/extras/abf08a966a2be3159c14a28e4347cf03.mp4?t=1747473653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2734\ufe0f <i>After the turret gains its special power:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990220/extras/89773951db285cf7b5a12c449e266214.poster.avif?t=1747473653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990220/extras/89773951db285cf7b5a12c449e266214.webm?t=1747473653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990220/extras/89773951db285cf7b5a12c449e266214.mp4?t=1747473653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2705\ufe0f Shortcuts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1:</strong> Build Laser / Upgrade damage<br><strong>2:</strong> Build Missile / Upgrade rate<br><strong>3:</strong> Build Tazer / Upgrade range<br><strong>4:</strong> Build Mortar / Move<br><strong>5:</strong> Build Sniper<br><strong>6:</strong> Build Minigun<br><strong>Del:</strong> Sell<br><strong>+:</strong> Fast forward<br><strong>Esc:</strong> Deselect / Cancel / Pause<br><strong>Enter:</strong> Next Wave</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2705\ufe0f Basic Weapon Specs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Laser:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attacks enemies with a balanced combination of power and attack frequency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Missile:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fires homing missiles towards enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tazer:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slows down enemies for a certain duration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mortar:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Has high power but takes time to hit and may miss. Generates an explosion that affects multiple enemies simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sniper:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Has extremely high power, but low attack frequency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minigun:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Has low power, but possesses overwhelming attack frequency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2705\ufe0f Special Abilities (* Require two Lv10 upgrades)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Laser:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Has a 1-in-9 chance of transfering the enemy to the starting position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Missile:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Generates an explosion at the location of attack, damaging multiple enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tazer:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Permanently slows down the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mortar:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expands the explosion range and inflicts continuous burn damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sniper:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Has a 1-in-12 chance of instakilling the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minigun:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Generates a small explosion at the location of attack, damaging multiple enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>&quot;When the last fire fades, humanity falls.&quot;</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>VisiTD - Monster War: Dying Fire -</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2705\ufe0f Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Human civilization is nearing its end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An overwhelming swarm of hostile extraterrestrial creatures known as &quot;CREEP&quot; now fills the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Worse yet, they continue to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The great superpowers \u2014 America, Russia, China, and others \u2014 have already fallen.<br>The surviving remnants of humanity have gathered what little strength remains, clinging to a faint hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As humanity's final commander, it is your mission to construct and upgrade evolving turrets, built using adapted enemy technology, in an effort to delay the inevitable extinction of mankind for even a little longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2015\u2015Death will come for you. But it must come as late as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;Protips from your predecessor, who fell honorably in battle:&gt;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When a turret fully upgrades two of its skills, it will unlock a special ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each turret, created with enemy technology, gains experience and grows stronger with every enemy defeated.<br>As they level up, their attack power increases, and they are able to attack faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">May your final stand be one without regret, having given everything you had.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705\ufe0f Turrets gain experience and level up! (Each turret keeps a separate kill count!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990220/extras